OL,3,ATrump to remove Rwanda and South Africa
OL,4,Afrom US trade deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has notified
OL,7,FCongress of his intention to remove
OL,8,FSouth Africa and Rwanda from a
OL,9,Fpreferential trade programme, from 1
OL,10,FJanuary 2027.
OL,12,FThe African Growth and Opportunity Act
OL,13,F(Agoa) allows eligible African
OL,14,Fcountries to export thousands of
OL,15,Fproducts to the US duty-free.
OL,17,FUS Trade Representative Jamieson Greer
OL,18,Fsaid in a statement that an annual
OL,19,Freview had found that both countries
OL,20,Fwere engaging in practices inconsistent
OL,21,Fwith the programme's eligibility
OL,22,Frequirements.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
